## Mandatory Rules
- In any code analysis, you MUST explicitly state the responsible author next to each file or code block.
- ZERO placeholders or fake in-memory mocks. Everything must be robust, typed and backed by real database models.
- Always verify build and lint before concluding.
- Always grant explicit GREEN LIGHT ("Luz Verde") for GitHub push once verified.
